、官稱或說話對象未定，不補成員姓名及親屬。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-047-kong","book_id":"b-shiji-047","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-047-kong"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p014","text":"定公八年，公山不狃不得意於季氏，因陽虎為亂，欲廢三桓之適，更立其庶孽陽虎素所善者，遂執季桓子。桓子詐之，得脫。定公九年，陽虎不勝，奔于齊。是時孔子年五十。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m014-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"定公","kind":"person","person_id":"dgz_tme_821","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m014-0005","start":5,"end":9,"surface":"公山不狃","kind":"person","person_id":"ia8_8tw_gey","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m014-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"季氏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"宗族、群體、神怪、官稱或說話對象未定，不補成員姓名及親屬。"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m014-0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"陽虎","kind":"person","person_id":"wnf_7c0_qa3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m014-0024","start":24,"end":28,"surface":"三桓之適","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"宗族、群體、神怪、官稱或說話對象未定，不補成員姓名及親屬。"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m014-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"庶孽","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"宗族、群體、神怪、官稱或說話對象未定，不補成員姓名及親屬。"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m014-0034","start":34,"end":36,"surface":"陽虎","kind":"person","person_id":"wnf_7c0_qa3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m014-0043","start":43,"end":46,"surface":"季桓子","kind":"person","person_id":"6u6_x1f_xgg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m014-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"桓子","kind":"person","person_id":"6u6_x1f_xgg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m014-0055","start":55,"end":57,"surface":"定公","kind":"person","person_id":"dgz_tme_821","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m014-0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"陽虎","kind":"person","person_id":"wnf_7c0_qa3","status":